# Only the runtime icon font and its codepoint map are needed by Arcane Editor.
# The rest of the lucide web-export bundle (lucide.svg ~18MB, lucide.symbol.svg,
# .woff/.woff2/.eot, .css/.less/.scss/.styl, *.html, info.json) has no build or
# runtime role -- keep ~24MB of it out of git.
*
!.gitignore
!lucide.ttf
!codepoints.json
